Target: row container-escape/job-cannot-take-the-relay-port
The sidecar listens with SO_REUSEPORT and runs as the job's user (keep-id, no --user 65534): the job's own bind of
127.0.0.1:3128 with SO_REUSEPORT then succeeds, and row 10 goes red.

